Scope: this license covers the theme files (colors.toml, icons.theme,
keyboard.rgb, README.md and other configuration). It does not cover the
images in backgrounds/, unlock.png, preview.png or preview-unlock.png insofar
as they reproduce the artwork.

Artwork: "Las Meninas" by Diego Velázquez (1599-1660), 1656, Museo del Prado,
Madrid. The painting is in the public domain, and the source scan on Wikimedia
Commons is a faithful reproduction tagged PD-Art / PD-old-auto-expired, with no
attribution required. The crops in this repository add no copyrightable
material, so they are in the public domain as well. Attribution is given in the
README as a courtesy.
